abstract: "PromptShift is a sovereign, zero-retention developer tool that deterministically transpiles, sanitizes, and synchronizes AI coding guidelines across Cursor (.cursorrules, .mdc), Anthropic Claude Code (CLAUDE.md), GitHub Copilot (copilot-instructions.md), and Codeium Windsurf (.windsurfrules) with 98.5% certified semantic fidelity and real-time sync-on-save."
